{"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Noun"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"list","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"nouns","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"GameText","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Noun","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Noun","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV4NounV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GameText","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Noun","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Noun","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV4NounV"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"nouns","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The phrases to join, in the order they should","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"read.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Return Value","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"One noun standing for all of them."}]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/TextAndRandomness"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"That number is the reason this is here and not at the call site."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"English agrees with the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"list"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", and a list is plural two ways: when","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it holds more than one thing, ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"or"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" when the only thing it holds is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"itself plural. Counting alone gets the second wrong, and the engine","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"got it wrong — one plural thing in a box printed “In the hamper is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"some scales.” A game re-voicing that line would have had to re-derive","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"the rule from scratch and could have made the same mistake; this is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the rule written once, in the type that exists to own it."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An empty list is plural (“none of them are here”) and renders as the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"empty phrase. No stock line calls one with nothing in it — the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"callers all branch on empty first, with a line of their own — but a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"game’s might, and silently reading as singular would be the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"defect one case further out."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Noun\/list(_:)"},"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/gnusto\/gametext\/noun\/list(_:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Type Method","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Gnusto"}],"exter